WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.270
Speaker 1: 2024 candidate Donald Trump went
to East Palestine, Ohio yesterday and held

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:08.270
an event.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.550
The event was completely deranged.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:13.010
Trump talked about football.

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.080
Trump brought Trump water.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.510
He went to a McDonald's.

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:22.460
He told people to have fun, and the entire
event was a complete and total farce that

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.130
went horribly wrong right away.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:31.500
In this first clip, Trump falsely claims that
the Biden administration intends to do nothing

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.790
about what took place in Ohio, but that his
presence there got them to all of a sudden

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.820
start doing things.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:38.820
Speaker 2: That's what it is.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:40.630
This is really America right here.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:41.879
We're standing in America.

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:47.580
Unfortunately, as you know, in too many cases,
your goodness and perseverance were met with

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.670
indifference and betrayal in some cases.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:58.899
Biden and FEMA said they would not send federal
aid to East Palestine under any circumstance.

00:00:58.899 --> 00:01:00.670
They're not going to send aid.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:04.479
I just thought that was a strange statement
because I've been working with FEMA for a

00:01:04.479 --> 00:01:09.290
long time, for years, and they were great
with us with the tornadoes, the hurricanes

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.040
and things like this.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:15.250
And it was a strange statement to come out
And they were doing nothing for you.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.180
They were.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:19.250
Intending to do absolutely nothing for you.

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.540
J.D. and I spoke and they said they're not
coming.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.540
They're not going to come.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.610
And I said, That's very strange.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:30.659
FEMA said specifically, this doesn't meet
the criteria and that's horrible.

00:01:30.659 --> 00:01:33.710
And somebody has to do something for those
people.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:37.922
I said back when I announced that I was coming,
they changed their tune.

00:01:37.922 --> 00:01:39.570
It was an amazing phenomena.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:42.160
The mayor and I were discussing that.

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:44.329
It was quite amazing what happened.

00:01:44.329 --> 00:01:48.680
Yeah, they said that we can't let this happen.

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.470
It was a big change face.

00:01:50.470 --> 00:01:51.470
J.D.

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:53.010
Did you ever see a change like that running?

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:54.010
That was a quick yeah.

00:01:54.010 --> 00:01:58.250
Speaker 1: As you know, of course, Trump has
an unblemished record as the beacon of corporate

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.670
responsibility and is just the perfect person
to really turn to on this issue and hold big

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:04.810
corporations accountable.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:09.259
Now, nothing that he's saying there is true,
but he does have to make himself the center

00:02:09.259 --> 00:02:10.259
of attention.

00:02:10.259 --> 00:02:14.920
Trump also says that he brought Trump water
for people, even though when we research it,

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:19.470
it seems like Trump water hasn't actually
been a thing for a very long time.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:23.080
But what it seems like it is, is Trump gets
labels for some other water and just puts

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.209
them on.

00:02:24.209 --> 00:02:25.209
It's all crazy.

00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:30.450
But he says he brought Trump water for people
in East Palestine, but he also brought like

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.660
lower quality water for them as well.

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:36.040
In case some people don't want the great water,
I guess I don't know.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:41.610
Speaker 2: Especially thank some of the incredible
people that helped us because we're bringing

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.280
thousands of bottle of water.

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:47.170
Trump Water actually cross-border some of
it.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:51.239
We had to go to a much lesser quality water.

00:02:51.239 --> 00:02:54.010
You want to get those Trump bottles, I think
more than anybody else.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:55.010
But we're bringing a lot of help.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:03:00.540
Speaker 1: He brought good water and he also
brought lower quality water for people.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.129
Absolutely beyond parody.

00:03:02.129 --> 00:03:08.510
The reality, of course, in terms of Trump's
record on train regulations is that there

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:17.170
were safety rules put in place by the Obama
administration for high hazard cargo trains,

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.120
which Trump then said, Oh, Obama did that.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.200
I'm now yes, Obama.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:24.840
Then I'm going to go ahead and repeal those.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.610
And that is exactly what took place.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:31.340
Trump then started ranting about football,
if you can believe it.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:33.020
Speaker 2: You know, remind me a little bit.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.810
I don't know if you remember when Ohio State
was going to be playing football for another

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:37.810
season.

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:42.200
They were going to sit back and watch with
the China virus or COVID, whatever you want

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.050
to call it.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.080
And I called the head of the Big Ten, Big
Ten football.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:50.490
He said, you got to get this football open.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:51.490
And they were great.

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:53.740
They responded and Ohio State played that
season.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:58.120
Speaker 1: Now, the Big Ten denies that Trump
had any involvement in this, but it is one

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.120
of those stories that Trump loves to repeat.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:02.000
Speaker 2: Nobody remembers that, I think.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.000
Right.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.000
Does anybody?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:05.000
Speaker 1: Because it didn't happen.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.620
Speaker 2: You know, And you got at least
one at least one you could be close to.

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:10.709
And by now you still would be close, probably.

00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:13.310
But we got that open very early.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.030
And you had a great season of football.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.030
Yep.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.220
Speaker 1: All thanks to Trump, of course.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:22.340
And then lastly, even though Trump is obese,
he makes a fat joke about East Palestine.

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:26.340
Mayor Trent Conaway saying that he's very
easy to find because he's overweight.

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.340
Right.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.340
So how could you possibly miss him?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:32.280
Speaker 2: I also want to recognize a man
who has been working tirelessly for this community

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:34.639
since the beginning of the nightmare.

00:04:34.639 --> 00:04:37.150
And Trent, where's Trent?

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:40.990
He's very easy to find, huh?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:49.700
Speaker 1: Yeah, it it I do think Trump doesn't
see himself as obese because he so frequently

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:55.850
talks about other people's weight and size
while claiming to be six three and weighing

00:04:55.850 --> 00:05:02.389
only 239, which, uh, oh God, what is happening
in this country?

00:05:02.389 --> 00:05:08.530
So anyway, there is Trump's very inspiring
visit to East Palestine, taking credit for

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:09.910
things he didn't do.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:18.400
Ignoring his own role in reducing train regulations,
calling the mayor fat and then going to McDonald's

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:23.120
and, I don't know, handing out MAGA hats as
he did.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.950
Another horrible embarrassment.

